BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 656 Td (A scheduled batch ETL example moves bounded order data from PostgreSQL to an S3 raw prefix,) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 643 Td (transforms it with AWS Glue/PySpark into partitioned Parquet, and loads it into a PostgreSQL) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 630 Td (analytics table through an upsert. Airflow coordinates the runtime path, while pandas helpers) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 617 Td (make deterministic logic easy to unit-test.) Tj ET
BT /FB 15 Tf 0.06 0.27 0.48 rg 52 599 Td (Business value) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 574 Td (Operational order tables should not carry heavy analytics workloads. This design separates) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 561 Td (ingestion, transformation and reporting, gives analysts a clean fact table, and creates) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 548 Td (intermediate storage that can support replay once run-specific immutable keys are added.) Tj ET
BT /FB 15 Tf 0.06 0.27 0.48 rg 52 530 Td (60-second interview introduction) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 505 Td (I built a compact AWS batch ETL reference pipeline for orders. Airflow extracts a) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 492 Td (caller-defined date window from PostgreSQL, uploads raw CSV to S3, starts a Glue PySpark) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 479 Td (transformation, and loads curated Parquet into a PostgreSQL fact table with an order_id) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 466 Td (upsert. CI verifies the reusable transformation, quality rules, AI-disabled behavior and Glue) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 453 Td (polling states. I call it a portfolio implementation rather than production-ready because live) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 440 Td (integration, durable watermarking, quarantine, run isolation and infrastructure automation) Tj ET
BT /FB 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 427 Td (remain to be completed.) Tj ET
BT /FB 15 Tf 0.06 0.27 0.48 rg 52 409 Td (Honest status) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 384 Td (The repository has passing unit CI and real implementation code, but it is not) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 371 Td (deployment-ready and has not been proven end-to-end against live PostgreSQL, Airflow, S3, Glue) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 358 Td (and Bedrock in CI.) Tj ET
