BT /FB 15 Tf 0.06 0.27 0.48 rg 52 401 Td (Step 6 - Advisory triage) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.15 0.19 rg 52 376 Td (The final optional task sends aggregate curated object count and byte metrics to Bedrock when) Tj ET
